<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts CompUSA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts CompUSA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating on CompUSA Inc to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Earlier in the day, CompUSA said its second quarter same-store sales rose 1.5 percent. The retailer said total sales for the quarter ended December 28 rose to $1.2 billion from $983 million.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
